{"version":"phase5-batch2","created":"2026-05-07","texts":[
{"id":"pt_text_homer_iliad_18_shield","title_original":"Iliad XVIII.478-489","title_ja":"イーリアス第18巻 アキレウスの盾の場面","author_name_display":"Homer","era_year":-750,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・archaic","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"叙事詩","meter_prosody":"ヘクサメトロス","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"ἐν μὲν γαῖαν ἔτευξ᾽, ἐν δ᾽ οὐρανόν, ἐν δὲ θάλασσαν,\nἠέλιόν τ᾽ ἀκάμαντα σελήνην τε πλήθουσαν","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Hom.+Il.+18.478","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_homer_il_22_hector","title_original":"Iliad XXII.395-404","title_ja":"イーリアス第22巻 ヘクトールの死","author_name_display":"Homer","era_year":-750,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・archaic","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"叙事詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"ἕκτορα δ᾽ ἑλκέμεναι κακὰ μήδετο δῖος Ἀχιλλεὺς·\nἀμφοτέρων μετόπισθε ποδῶν τέτρηνε τένοντε","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Hom.+Il.+22.395","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_homer_od_5_ulysses","title_original":"Odyssey V.215-220","title_ja":"オデュッセイア第5巻 カリュプソの島","author_name_display":"Homer","era_year":-720,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・archaic","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"叙事詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"εἰ δ᾽ αὖ τις ῥαίῃσι θεῶν ἐνὶ οἴνοπι πόντῳ,\nτλήσομαι ἐν στήθεσσιν ἔχων ταλαπενθέα θυμόν","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Hom.+Od.+5.215","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_homeric_hymn_demeter","title_original":"Homeric Hymn to Demeter 1-3","title_ja":"ホメロス風賛歌『デーメーテール讃歌』冒頭","author_name_display":"（伝・ホメロス派）","era_year":-650,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・archaic","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"讃歌","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Δήμητρ᾽ ἠΰκομον σεμνὴν θεὰν ἄρχομ᾽ ἀείδειν,\nαὐτὴν ἠδὲ θύγατρα τανύσφυρον","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=HH+2","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_homeric_hymn_aphrodite","title_original":"Homeric Hymn to Aphrodite","title_ja":"ホメロス風賛歌『アプロディーテー讃歌』冒頭","author_name_display":"（伝）","era_year":-650,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・archaic","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"讃歌","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Μοῦσά μοι ἔννεπε ἔργα πολυχρύσου Ἀφροδίτης,\nΚύπριδος","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=HH+5","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_sappho_1","title_original":"Sappho fr.1 (Hymn to Aphrodite)","title_ja":"サッフォー断片1 アプロディーテー讃歌","author_name_display":"Sappho","era_year":-600,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・archaic","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"抒情詩","meter_prosody":"サッポー詩体","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"ποικιλόθρον᾽ ἀθάνατ᾽ Ἀφρόδιτα,\nπαῖ Δίος δολόπλοκε, λίσσομαί σε","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Perseus%3Atext%3A2008.01.0479","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_sappho_2","title_original":"Sappho fr.2","title_ja":"サッフォー断片2","author_name_display":"Sappho","era_year":-600,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・archaic","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"抒情詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"δεῦρύ μ᾽ ἐκ Κρήτας ἐπ[ὶ τόνδ]ε ναῦον\nἄγνον, ὄππ[αι ] χάριεν μὲν ἄλσος\nμαλί[αν]","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_anacreon_fr358","title_original":"Anacreon fr.358","title_ja":"アナクレオン断片358","author_name_display":"Anacreon","era_year":-540,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・archaic","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"抒情詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"σφαίρῃ δηὖτέ με πορφυρῇ\nβάλλων χρυσοκόμης Ἔρως","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_pindar_pythian_1","title_original":"Pindar Pythian 1","title_ja":"ピンダロス『ピューティア祝勝歌』第1歌冒頭","author_name_display":"Pindar","era_year":-470,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・classical","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"祝勝歌","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"χρυσέα φόρμιγξ, Ἀπόλλωνος καὶ ἰοπλοκάμων\nσύνδικον Μοισᾶν κτέανον","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Pind.+P.+1","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_aeschylus_prometheus","title_original":"Aeschylus, Prometheus Bound 88-100","title_ja":"アイスキュロス『縛られたプロメテウス』独白","author_name_display":"Aeschylus","era_year":-460,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・classical","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"悲劇","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"ὦ δῖος αἰθὴρ καὶ ταχύπτεροι πνοαί,\nποταμῶν τε πηγαί, ποντίων τε κυμάτων\nἀνήριθμον γέλασμα","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Aesch.+PB+88","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_sophocles_antigone_chorus","title_original":"Sophocles, Antigone 332-340","title_ja":"ソフォクレス『アンティゴネー』人間賛歌（合唱歌）","author_name_display":"Sophocles","era_year":-441,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・classical","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"悲劇合唱歌","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"πολλὰ τὰ δεινὰ κοὐδὲν ἀν-\nθρώπου δεινότερον πέλει","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Soph.+Ant.+332","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":1,"concept_links":[{"concept_id":"cp_catharsis","link_type":"分析対象"}]},
{"id":"pt_text_euripides_medea","title_original":"Euripides, Medea 1078-1080","title_ja":"エウリピデス『メーデイア』内省独白","author_name_display":"Euripides","era_year":-431,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・classical","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"悲劇","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"καὶ μανθάνω μὲν οἷα δρᾶν μέλλω κακά,\nθυμὸς δὲ κρείσσων τῶν ἐμῶν βουλευμάτων","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Eur.+Med.+1078","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_aristophanes_lysistrata","title_original":"Aristophanes, Lysistrata 706-710","title_ja":"アリストパネス『女の平和』","author_name_display":"Aristophanes","era_year":-411,"era_period":"古代ギリシャ・classical","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"喜劇","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"ὦ πότνιαι, τέλος μὲν ὅπερ θέλομεν\nἂν τάχα φήνωσιν","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Ar.+Lys.+706","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_callimachus_aetia","title_original":"Callimachus, Aetia fr.1","title_ja":"カリマコス『縁起譚』断片1","author_name_display":"Callimachus","era_year":-275,"era_period":"hellenistic","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"アエティオン","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"πρὸς δέ με Τελχῖνες ἐπιτρύζουσιν ἀοιδῇ,\nνήιδες οἳ Μούσης οὐκ ἐγένοντο φίλοι","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_theocritus_idyll_1","title_original":"Theocritus, Idyll 1","title_ja":"テオクリトス『田園詩』第1歌","author_name_display":"Theocritus","era_year":-270,"era_period":"hellenistic","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"田園詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Ἁδύ τι τὸ ψιθύρισμα καὶ ἁ πίτυς αἰπόλε τήνα,\nἁ ποτὶ ταῖς παγαῖσι, μελίσδεται","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Theoc.+1","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_apollonius_argonautica","title_original":"Apollonius, Argonautica I.1","title_ja":"アポローニオス『アルゴナウティカ』第1巻冒頭","author_name_display":"Apollonius Rhodius","era_year":-250,"era_period":"hellenistic","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"grc","form_genre":"叙事詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"ἀρχόμενος σέο, Φοῖβε, παλαιγενέων κλέα φωτῶν\nμνήσομαι","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Ap.+Rhod.+1.1","source_archive":"Perseus Digital Library","canonical_tier":1,"concept_links":[{"concept_id":"cp_argonautica_allusive_epic","link_type":"分析対象"}]},
{"id":"pt_text_horace_carmen_3_30","title_original":"Horace Odes 3.30 'Exegi monumentum'","title_ja":"ホラティウス『カルミナ』III.30「我は記念碑を建てた」","author_name_display":"Horace","era_year":-23,"era_period":"Augustan","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"頌歌","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Exegi monumentum aere perennius\nregalique situ pyramidum altius,\nquod non imber edax, non Aquilo impotens\npossit diruere","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/horace/carm3.shtml","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_horace_ars_poetica","title_original":"Horace, Ars Poetica 1-13","title_ja":"ホラティウス『詩論』冒頭","author_name_display":"Horace","era_year":-19,"era_period":"Augustan","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"教訓詩・詩論","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Humano capiti cervicem pictor equinam\niungere si velit, et varias inducere plumas\nundique collatis membris","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/horace/arspoet.shtml","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":1,"concept_links":[{"concept_id":"cp_mimesis","link_type":"分析対象"}]},
{"id":"pt_text_virgil_eclogue_1","title_original":"Virgil, Eclogue 1.1-5","title_ja":"ウェルギリウス『牧歌』第1歌冒頭","author_name_display":"Virgil","era_year":-37,"era_period":"Augustan","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"田園詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Tityre, tu patulae recubans sub tegmine fagi\nsilvestrem tenui Musam meditaris avena","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/vergil/ec1.shtml","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_virgil_georgics_1","title_original":"Virgil, Georgics I.1-5","title_ja":"ウェルギリウス『農耕詩』第1巻冒頭","author_name_display":"Virgil","era_year":-29,"era_period":"Augustan","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"教訓詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Quid faciat laetas segetes, quo sidere terram\nvertere, Maecenas, ulmisque adiungere vitis\nconveniat","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/vergil/geo1.shtml","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_ovid_amores_1_1","title_original":"Ovid, Amores I.1","title_ja":"オウィディウス『恋の歌』I.1","author_name_display":"Ovid","era_year":-15,"era_period":"Augustan","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"恋愛悲歌","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Arma gravi numero violentaque bella parabam\nedere, materia conveniente modis","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/ovid/ovid.amor1.shtml","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_ovid_tristia_1_1","title_original":"Ovid, Tristia I.1","title_ja":"オウィディウス『悲しみの歌』I.1","author_name_display":"Ovid","era_year":9,"era_period":"Augustan","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"悲歌","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Parve—nec invideo—sine me, liber, ibis in urbem;\nei mihi! quo domino non licet ire tuo","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/ovid/ovid.tristia1.shtml","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_seneca_thyestes","title_original":"Seneca, Thyestes 391-403","title_ja":"セネカ『ティエステス』合唱","author_name_display":"Seneca","era_year":62,"era_period":"Imperial","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"悲劇合唱","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Stet quicumque volet potens\naulae culmine lubrico:\nme dulcis saturet quies","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/sen/sen.thy.shtml","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_lucan_pharsalia","title_original":"Lucan, Pharsalia I.1-7","title_ja":"ルカヌス『内乱』冒頭","author_name_display":"Lucan","era_year":65,"era_period":"Imperial","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"叙事詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Bella per Emathios plus quam civilia campos\niusque datum sceleri canimus","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/lucan/lucan1.shtml","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_statius_thebaid","title_original":"Statius, Thebaid I.1-4","title_ja":"スタティウス『テーバイス』冒頭","author_name_display":"Statius","era_year":92,"era_period":"Imperial","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"叙事詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Fraternas acies alternaque regna profanis\ndecertata odiis sontesque evolvere Thebas","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/statius/theb1.shtml","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_persius_sat_1","title_original":"Persius, Satire 1","title_ja":"ペルシウス『風刺詩』第1編","author_name_display":"Persius","era_year":62,"era_period":"Imperial","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"風刺詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"O curas hominum! O quantum est in rebus inane!\n'Quis leget haec?'","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/persius.html","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_claudian_panegyric","title_original":"Claudian, Panegyricus de Tertio Consulatu Honorii","title_ja":"クラウディアヌス『ホノリウス第三執政官就任頌』","author_name_display":"Claudian","era_year":396,"era_period":"Late Antique","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"頌詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Auspiciis iterum sese regalibus annus\ninduit","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/claudian.html","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":3},
{"id":"pt_text_prudentius_psychomachia","title_original":"Prudentius, Psychomachia preface","title_ja":"プルデンティウス『プシューコマキア』序","author_name_display":"Prudentius","era_year":405,"era_period":"Late Antique","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"寓意叙事詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Senex fidelis prima credendi via\nAbram beato lumine renitens","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/prud.html","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_boethius_consolatio","title_original":"Boethius, Consolatio 1.m.1","title_ja":"ボエティウス『哲学の慰め』第1巻歌1","author_name_display":"Boethius","era_year":524,"era_period":"Late Antique","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"哲学詩・プロシメトロン","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Carmina qui quondam studio florente peregi,\nflebilis heu maestos cogor inire modos.","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/boethius/cons1.shtml","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_venantius_pange","title_original":"Venantius Fortunatus, Pange lingua","title_ja":"ウェナンティウス・フォルトゥナトゥス「パンゲ・リングア（舌よ歌え）」","author_name_display":"Venantius Fortunatus","era_year":569,"era_period":"Late Antique","culture_region":"古代ギリシャ・ローマ","language_original":"lat","form_genre":"讃美歌","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Pange, lingua, gloriosi proelium certaminis\net super Crucis trophaeo dic triumphum nobilem","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.thelatinlibrary.com/venantius.html","source_archive":"The Latin Library","canonical_tier":2},

{"id":"pt_text_shijing_qiyue","title_original":"詩經・豳風・七月","title_ja":"詩経 豳風 七月","author_name_display":"詩経編者","era_year":-700,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"七月流火，九月授衣。\n一之日觱發，二之日栗烈。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩經/七月","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_shijing_jianjia","title_original":"詩經・秦風・蒹葭","title_ja":"詩経 秦風 蒹葭","author_name_display":"詩経編者","era_year":-700,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"蒹葭蒼蒼，白露為霜。\n所謂伊人，在水一方。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩經/蒹葭","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_chuci_jiuge","title_original":"楚辭・九歌・東皇太一","title_ja":"楚辞 九歌 東皇太一","author_name_display":"屈原","era_year":-300,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楚辞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"吉日兮辰良，穆將愉兮上皇。\n撫長劍兮玉珥，璆鏘鳴兮琳琅。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/楚辭/九歌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_chuci_tianwen","title_original":"楚辭・天問","title_ja":"楚辞 天問 冒頭","author_name_display":"屈原","era_year":-300,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楚辞・問答詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"曰：遂古之初，誰傳道之？\n上下未形，何由考之？","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/楚辭/天問","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_caopi_yange","title_original":"曹丕・燕歌行","title_ja":"曹丕 燕歌行","author_name_display":"曹丕","era_year":215,"era_period":"後漢末","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"秋風蕭瑟天氣涼，草木搖落露為霜。\n群燕辭歸雁南翔，念君客遊思斷腸。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/燕歌行","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_taoyuanming_guiyuantian","title_original":"陶淵明・歸園田居・其一","title_ja":"陶淵明 帰園田居 其一","author_name_display":"陶淵明","era_year":405,"era_period":"東晋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"少無適俗韻，性本愛丘山。\n誤落塵網中，一去三十年。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/歸園田居","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_xiekang_youzhi","title_original":"嵇康・幽憤詩","title_ja":"嵇康 幽憤詩","author_name_display":"嵇康","era_year":262,"era_period":"三国魏","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"嗟余薄祜，少遭不造。\n哀煢靡識，越在襁褓。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/幽憤詩","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_xiezhi_dengchishuyilou","title_original":"謝朓・玉階怨","title_ja":"謝朓 玉階怨","author_name_display":"謝朓","era_year":495,"era_period":"南斉","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"夕殿下珠簾，流螢飛復息。\n長夜縫羅衣，思君此何極。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/玉階怨","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_baolin_nigujue","title_original":"鮑照・擬古詩","title_ja":"鮑照 擬古詩","author_name_display":"鮑照","era_year":460,"era_period":"南朝宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"幽并重騎射，少年好馳逐。\n氈帶佩雙鞬，象弧插雕服。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/擬古詩","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_libai_qingjingye","title_original":"李白・月下獨酌・其二","title_ja":"李白 月下独酌 其二","author_name_display":"李白","era_year":744,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"天若不愛酒，酒星不在天。\n地若不愛酒，地應無酒泉。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/月下獨酌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_libai_zaofa_baidicheng","title_original":"李白・早發白帝城","title_ja":"李白 早発白帝城","author_name_display":"李白","era_year":759,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"朝辭白帝彩雲間，千里江陵一日還。\n兩岸猿聲啼不住，輕舟已過萬重山。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/早發白帝城","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_libai_zhanzhanghuai","title_original":"李白・宣州謝朓樓餞別校書叔雲","title_ja":"李白 宣州謝朓楼にて校書叔雲を餞別す","author_name_display":"李白","era_year":753,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"棄我去者昨日之日不可留，\n亂我心者今日之日多煩憂。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/宣州謝朓樓餞別校書叔雲","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_dufu_qiuxing_1","title_original":"杜甫・秋興八首・其一","title_ja":"杜甫 秋興八首 其一","author_name_display":"杜甫","era_year":766,"era_period":"晩唐期杜甫","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"玉露凋傷楓樹林，巫山巫峽氣蕭森。\n江間波浪兼天湧，塞上風雲接地陰。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/秋興","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_dufu_dengao","title_original":"杜甫・登高","title_ja":"杜甫 登高","author_name_display":"杜甫","era_year":767,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言律詩","length_lines":8,"full_text_or_excerpt":"風急天高猿嘯哀，渚清沙白鳥飛迴。\n無邊落木蕭蕭下，不盡長江滾滾來。\n萬里悲秋常作客，百年多病獨登臺。\n艱難苦恨繁霜鬢，潦倒新停濁酒杯。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/登高","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_dufu_jiang","title_original":"杜甫・絕句","title_ja":"杜甫 絶句「両個黄鸝」","author_name_display":"杜甫","era_year":764,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"兩個黃鸝鳴翠柳，一行白鷺上青天。\n窗含西嶺千秋雪，門泊東吳萬里船。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/絕句_(兩個黃鸝鳴翠柳)","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangwei_songbie","title_original":"王維・送別","title_ja":"王維 送別「山中相送罷」","author_name_display":"王維","era_year":740,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"山中相送罷，日暮掩柴扉。\n春草明年綠，王孫歸不歸？","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/送別_(山中相送罷)","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_baijuyi_pipa","title_original":"白居易・琵琶行","title_ja":"白居易 琵琶行（冒頭）","author_name_display":"白居易","era_year":816,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"潯陽江頭夜送客，楓葉荻花秋瑟瑟。\n主人下馬客在船，舉酒欲飲無管絃。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/琵琶行","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_lishangyin_yeyu","title_original":"李商隱・夜雨寄北","title_ja":"李商隠 夜雨寄北","author_name_display":"李商隠","era_year":850,"era_period":"晩唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"君問歸期未有期，巴山夜雨漲秋池。\n何當共剪西窗燭，卻話巴山夜雨時。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/夜雨寄北","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_dumu_qiuxi","title_original":"杜牧・秋夕","title_ja":"杜牧 秋夕","author_name_display":"杜牧","era_year":843,"era_period":"晩唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"銀燭秋光冷畫屏，輕羅小扇撲流螢。\n天階夜色涼如水，臥看牽牛織女星。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/秋夕","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_mengjiao_youzimu","title_original":"孟郊・遊子吟","title_ja":"孟郊 遊子吟","author_name_display":"孟郊","era_year":796,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":6,"full_text_or_excerpt":"慈母手中線，遊子身上衣。\n臨行密密縫，意恐遲遲歸。\n誰言寸草心，報得三春暉。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/遊子吟","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangbo_tengwangge","title_original":"王勃・送杜少府之任蜀州","title_ja":"王勃 送杜少府之任蜀州","author_name_display":"王勃","era_year":675,"era_period":"初唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"城闕輔三秦，風煙望五津。\n與君離別意，同是宦遊人。\n海內存知己，天涯若比鄰。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/送杜少府之任蜀州","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_chenziang_dengyou","title_original":"陳子昂・登幽州臺歌","title_ja":"陳子昂 登幽州台歌","author_name_display":"陳子昂","era_year":696,"era_period":"初唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"前不見古人，後不見來者。\n念天地之悠悠，獨愴然而涕下！","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/登幽州臺歌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_liuyuxi_louscishi","title_original":"劉禹錫・陋室銘","title_ja":"劉禹錫 陋室銘","author_name_display":"劉禹錫","era_year":824,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"駢文","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"山不在高，有仙則名。\n水不在深，有龍則靈。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/陋室銘","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_sushi_chibifu","title_original":"蘇軾・前赤壁賦","title_ja":"蘇軾 前赤壁賦","author_name_display":"蘇軾","era_year":1082,"era_period":"北宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"賦","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"壬戌之秋，七月既望，蘇子與客泛舟，遊於赤壁之下。\n清風徐來，水波不興。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/前赤壁賦","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_ouyangxiu_zuiweng","title_original":"歐陽修・醉翁亭記","title_ja":"欧陽脩 酔翁亭記","author_name_display":"欧陽脩","era_year":1046,"era_period":"北宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"散文","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"環滁皆山也。其西南諸峰，林壑尤美，望之蔚然而深秀者，琅琊也。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/醉翁亭記","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_lu_you_shifeng","title_original":"陸游・示兒","title_ja":"陸游 示児","author_name_display":"陸游","era_year":1210,"era_period":"南宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"死去元知萬事空，但悲不見九州同。\n王師北定中原日，家祭無忘告乃翁。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/示兒","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_yueyei_man_jiang_hong","title_original":"岳飛・滿江紅","title_ja":"岳飛 満江紅「怒髮衝冠」","author_name_display":"岳飛","era_year":1136,"era_period":"南宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"怒髮衝冠，憑闌處、瀟瀟雨歇。\n抬望眼、仰天長嘯，壯懷激烈。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/滿江紅_(怒髮衝冠)","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_huang_tingjian_jiyou","title_original":"黃庭堅・寄黃幾復","title_ja":"黄庭堅 寄黄幾復","author_name_display":"黄庭堅","era_year":1080,"era_period":"北宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"我居北海君南海，寄雁傳書謝不能。\n桃李春風一杯酒，江湖夜雨十年燈。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/寄黃幾復","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_jiang_kui_yangzhou","title_original":"姜夔・揚州慢","title_ja":"姜夔 揚州慢","author_name_display":"姜夔","era_year":1176,"era_period":"南宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"淮左名都，竹西佳處，解鞍少駐初程。\n過春風十里，盡薺麥青青。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/揚州慢","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_yuan_haowen_zheng","title_original":"元好問・摸魚兒・雁丘詞","title_ja":"元好問 摸魚児・雁丘詞","author_name_display":"元好問","era_year":1205,"era_period":"金末","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"問世間，情是何物，直教生死相許？\n天南地北雙飛客，老翅幾回寒暑。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/摸魚兒_(問世間)","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_ming_yuan_mei","title_original":"袁枚・苔","title_ja":"袁枚 苔","author_name_display":"袁枚","era_year":1750,"era_period":"清","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"白日不到處，青春恰自來。\n苔花如米小，也學牡丹開。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/苔_(袁枚)","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_huangzunxian_zatan","title_original":"黃遵憲・雜感","title_ja":"黄遵憲 雑感","author_name_display":"黄遵憲","era_year":1880,"era_period":"清末","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言古詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"我手寫吾口，古豈能拘牽？\n即今流俗語，我若登簡編。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/黃遵憲","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2}
]}
